        "original_id": "dab7d53d-8ecd-5517-886e-31f806a15046",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Boone\n- Places: Arcadia, Tennessee; Jenkins, Kentucky; Poland\n- Events: Green-Jones War\n- Infrastructure: Daniel Boone's trail; National Road\n- Organizations: WKVG\n\nFacts:\n- In 1775, Daniel Boone's trail ran through Arcadia, Tennessee.\n- Daniel Boone's trail led into Poland.\n- Daniel Boone's trail was near one of the locales of the Green-Jones War.\n- Daniel Boone's trail was rejected as the route for the National Road.\n- WKVG is licensed to Jenkins, Kentucky.",
